  <VSIE_BingeParty.label>狂歡派對</VSIE_BingeParty.label>
  <!-- EN: The feast has been called off. -->
  <VSIE_BingeParty.calledOffMessage>狂歡派對被取消了。</VSIE_BingeParty.calledOffMessage>
  <!-- EN: The feast has finished. -->
  <VSIE_BingeParty.finishedMessage>狂歡派對結束了。</VSIE_BingeParty.finishedMessage>
  <!-- EN: {ORGANIZER_labelShort} suggests doing a little binge party. Be warned - Binge parties can last up to a few hours. Colonists will binge on food and drugs until it is over. Simply draft your colonists to stop them taking part in the binge party. -->
  <VSIE_BingeParty.letterText>{ORGANIZER_labelShort}建議大家辦個狂歡派對。要註意的是，狂歡派對可能會持續幾個小時。殖民者會狂吃食物和成癮品直到派對結束。簡單地征召殖民者可以阻止他們參與狂歡派對。</VSIE_BingeParty.letterText>
  <!-- EN: Binge party -->
  <VSIE_BingeParty.letterTitle>狂歡派對</VSIE_BingeParty.letterTitle>
  
